WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
Two roots this week are about speaking.

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:06.600
Voc, or voke, means voice or call.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.770
Dict means say.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:12.690
Then a year of spelling patterns, all in one sort.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.930
In the game, read each line and choose the word that fits the blank.
